   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BKG303 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12402 · Decision 04/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/01/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BKG303 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12402 · QĐ 04/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/01/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Explain the fundamental concepts and principles underlying the appraisal of investment projects, including the time value of money, cash flow estimation, and the cost of capital.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Apply discounted cash flow (DCF) techniques such as Net Present Value (NPV), Internal Rate of Return (IRR), and Adjusted Net Present Value (ANPV) to analyze and evaluate investment decisions.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Identify and evaluate the sources of risk and uncertainty in investment projects, employing methods such as sensitivity analysis, scenario analysis, and Monte Carlo simulation to assess their impact on project viability.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Compare and contrast various investment appraisal methods, including payback period, discounted payback period, and Accounting Rate of Return (ARR), and understand their limitations and applications.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Analyze the effects of financing and taxation on investment decisions, understanding the implications of different financing structures and tax regimes on the appraisal of investment projects.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Demonstrate the ability to apply investment appraisal techniques to real-world scenarios, using case studies and project work to evaluate actual investment projects and make informed recommendations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Practice ability to work as part of an effective team to prepare report and presentation</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12402</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12402</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
